xfce4-appmenu-plugin's desktop menus (the menu bar with the desktop focused).
The Files, Documents, … items hand the launcher the menu helper, not a
widget, so every file item crashed the plugin (gtk_widget_get_display on a
plain object); hand it the menu widget. A file
with no application for its type launched NULL and crashed too: do nothing
then. A file's underscores no longer turn into mnemonics in its menu label.

